          "_comment": "R10 join-index (docs/comprehension_decision_ledger.md Wave 3): c and mention share no match variable -- only the where-clause Eq(mention.text, c.name) connects them, so the matcher would otherwise enumerate the full held-Concepts x accumulated-Mentions cross product every pass. This hint lets the matcher probe a live attr index (Concept.name) once `mention` is bound, instead of scanning every knows_concept edge. Same match/where/effects as before -- resolution behaviour is byte-identical, only the matcher's traversal cost changes (index-then-verify: see runners/dsl/src/rewrite.rs::hinted_candidates)."
